{"id":"00207","root":"uni00207_1","name":{"ja":"神田旅団兵士","en":"Kanda Brigade Soldier"},"title":null,"displayName":{"ja":"神田旅団兵士","en":"Kanda Brigade Soldier"},"element":"Science","rarity":1,"rarityLabel":"N","roles":[],"traits":[],"release":null,"limited":false,"characterId":157,"profile":{"ja":"海兵自衛軍の神田大佐率いる神田旅団の兵士。神田旅団は占領された島を奪還するために創設された海兵自衛軍の中でも異質の部隊で、時の首相が直接指揮をする独立部隊であり傭兵集団でもある。戦時中は主に非合法活動に従事、情報工作や要人暗殺、後方撹乱などで暗躍した。神田旅団は味方からも恐れられる無法者集団で知られ、非戦闘員の虐殺から略奪、婦女暴行などの数々の戦争犯罪の疑惑が存在するが、その優秀さと使い勝手の良さから時の権力者たちに重用された。戦後はほぼ事実上の幽閉といった態で北方の孤島に配置されていたが、その後も権力者たちが様々な汚れ仕事を任務として与え活かしてきた。最新鋭の装備で武装し、近接格闘のエキスパート揃いでもある。","en":"The Kanda Brigade soldier serves under Colonel Kanda in the Marine Self-Defense Force's Kanda Brigade. The brigade was formed as a special marine unit to retake occupied islands and operates as an independent force directly commanded by the prime minister, essentially functioning as a mercenary group. During wartime, its members primarily engaged in illicit activities such as intelligence work, high-profile assassinations, and rear-area disruption. The Kanda Brigade is feared even by allies and is suspected of numerous war crimes, including civilian massacres, looting, and sexual violence, yet its effectiveness and versatility kept it in high demand by those in power. After the war, its members were effectively confined to a remote northern island, but they continued to receive dirty jobs from various authorities. Equipped with cutting-edge gear, they are experts in close-quarter combat."},"illustrator":null,"voiceActor":null,"forms":[{"id":"uni00207_1","rarity":1,"rarityLabel":"N","levelMax":40,"stats":{"hp":[643,1185],"sp":[100,100],"atk":[74,146],"def":[58,125],"spd":[57,57],"luck":[0,0]},"spCharge":34,"skills":["5","230002"]}],"skills":{"5":{"slot":"attack","id":5,"name":null,"hits":1,"cutin":false,"levels":[{"level":1,"sp":0,"detail":{"ja":"科学属性ダメージ"}},{"level":2,"sp":0,"detail":{"ja":"科学属性ダメージ"}},{"level":3,"sp":0,"detail":{"ja":"科学属性ダメージ"}},{"level":4,"sp":0